---
/**
 * "Requisitos para empezar" / Starter Pack del flyer.
 * - Precio promocional $500 (regular $3,000) — banner OFERTA
 * - Recibe $750 saldo + 10 SIMs + materiales + Oficina Virtual
 */
---

<section id="pack" class="py-16 sm:py-20 bg-panda-surface">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4">
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <p class="font-poppins text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-panda-red font-semibold mb-3">Requisitos para empezar</p>
      <h2 class="font-unbounded text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-panda-dark mb-4">
        Pack inicial de<br/>
        <span class="text-panda-red">distribuidor</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="font-poppins text-base sm:text-lg text-panda-gray max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Todo lo que necesitas para empezar a vender HOY, sin inversión inicial alta.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl shadow-xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-100">
      <!-- HEADER con precio y oferta -->
      <div class="bg-panda-red px-8 py-10 text-white text-center relative overflow-hidden">
        <!-- Decorative circles -->
        <div class="absolute -top-10 -right-10 w-40 h-40 rounded-full bg-white/10"></div>
        <div class="absolute -bottom-12 -left-12 w-48 h-48 rounded-full bg-white/5"></div>

        <div class="relative">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-panda-green text-white text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-4">
            <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z" /></svg>
            Oferta especial de bienvenida
          </div>

          <p class="font-poppins text-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-white/85 mb-2">Recarga inicial promocional</p>
          <div class="flex items-baseline justify-center gap-3 mb-2">
            <span class="font-unbounded text-5xl sm:text-6xl font-bold">$500</span>
            <span class="font-poppins text-xl font-medium">MXN</span>
          </div>
          <p class="font-poppins text-sm text-white/80">
            <span class="line-through">Valor regular: $3,000 MXN</span>
            <span class="ml-2 inline-block bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-sm px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">Ahorra 83%</span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- BODY: bullets de contenido -->
      <div class="px-6 sm:px-10 py-10 sm:py-12">
        <h3 class="font-unbounded text-lg font-bold text-panda-dark text-center mb-6">
          ¿Qué incluye tu pack?
        </h3>

        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 sm:gap-5 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          <!-- Bono saldo -->
          <div class="flex gap-3 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-panda-green/5 border border-panda-green/20">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-panda-green/15 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-panda-green" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17 9V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2m2 4h10a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H9a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm7-5a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-unbounded font-bold text-panda-dark text-base mb-1">$750 MXN de saldo</p>
              <p class="font-poppins text-xs text-panda-gray leading-relaxed">
                Bono del <strong>25%</strong> en tu primera recarga — empiezas con más de lo que pagas.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 10 SIMs -->
          <div class="flex gap-3 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-panda-red/5 border border-panda-red/20">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-panda-red/15 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-panda-red" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M14 10l-2 1m0 0l-2-1m2 1v2.5M20 7l-2 1m2-1l-2-1m2 1v2.5M14 4l-2-1-2 1M4 7l2-1M4 7l2 1M4 7v2.5M12 21l-2-1m2 1l2-1m-2 1v-2.5M6 18l-2-1v-2.5M18 18l2-1v-2.5" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-unbounded font-bold text-panda-dark text-base mb-1">10 SIMs gratis</p>
              <p class="font-poppins text-xs text-panda-gray leading-relaxed">
                Empieza a activar líneas <strong>inmediatamente</strong>, sin inversión adicional.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Materiales -->
          <div class="flex gap-3 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-[#FFCD54]/5 border border-[#FFCD54]/20">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-[#FFCD54]/15 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-amber-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-unbounded font-bold text-panda-dark text-base mb-1">Materiales promocionales</p>
              <p class="font-poppins text-xs text-panda-gray leading-relaxed">
                Flyers y elementos publicitarios para <strong>impulsar tus ventas</strong>.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Oficina Virtual -->
          <div class="flex gap-3 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-panda-dark/5 border border-panda-dark/20">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-panda-dark/10 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-panda-dark" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9.75 17L9 20l-1 1h8l-1-1-.75-3M3 13h18M5 17h14a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-unbounded font-bold text-panda-dark text-base mb-1">Oficina Virtual + App</p>
              <p class="font-poppins text-xs text-panda-gray leading-relaxed">
                Acceso completo a la plataforma para <strong>administrar tu negocio</strong>.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Footer del card: empuje al form -->
        <div class="mt-10 text-center">
          <p class="font-unbounded text-lg font-bold text-panda-red mb-1">¡Empieza hoy!</p>
          <p class="font-poppins text-sm text-panda-gray mb-6">Sin requisitos adicionales para comenzar a generar ganancias.</p>
          <a
            href="#solicitud"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 rounded-full bg-panda-red text-white font-bold text-lg hover:bg-panda-red-dark transition-colors shadow-lg shadow-panda-red/30"
          >
            Solicitar mi pack
            <svg class="ml-2 w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
